span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">a</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">t</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">i</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">o</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">n</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-main);background-color:transparent;transition:all 0.1s\">.</span></div><textarea disabled=\"\" placeholder=\"Click &#x27;Start Test&#x27; to begin\" style=\"width:100%;height:150px;padding:20px;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.8;border:2px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:var(--border-radius);resize:none;outline:none;font-family:var(--font-geist-mono), monospace;background-color:#f1f5f9\"></textarea></div></section><section style=\"margin-top:60px;max-width:800px;margin:60px auto 0\"><h2>CGSSB Typing Requirements</h2><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px\">For most clerical positions in Chhattisgarh, the basic requirement is a data entry speed of <strong>5000 Key Depressions per hour (KPH)</strong>. For some specialized roles like DEO or Stenographer, it can go up to 8000 KPH or 30 Words Per Minute (WPM).</p><h3>Tips to Improve Accuracy:</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8\"><li>Always prioritize <strong>Accuracy</strong> over Speed. If you type fast but make many mistakes, your net WPM will drastically reduce.</li><li>Do not look at the keyboard. Practice touch typing.</li><li>Maintain a consistent rhythm rather than typing in bursts.</li></ul></section></div></main><footer style=\"background-color:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding:40px 0 20px;margin-top:60px\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Chhattisgarh Career &amp; Education Portal</h3><p style=\"max-width:600px;font-size:0.9rem\">One-stop destination for CGSSB, CGPSC, Vyapam notifications, syllabus, results, and study materials.</p><div style=\"max-width:800px;background-color:#fffbe8;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#92400e;text-align:left\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> CGSSB is an independent informational website and is not affiliated with or operated by the Government of Chhattisgarh, CGSSB, CG Vyapam, CGPSC, or any other government department or examination authority. For official information, please verify details from the relevant official website or notification.</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px;margin-top:25px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);width:100%;max-width:800px\"><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/author/yuvraj-pratap-rajwade\">Author</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/editorial-policy\">Editorial Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/correction-policy\">Correction Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var